      "content": "idk about derealization or whatever. it just feels like the truth. like i'm just taking up space. if i disappeared tomorrow, my boss would just hire someone else by monday and my landlord would just rent the room to someone else. there's no impact. no footprint. it's like i'm already gone, just waiting for my body to catch up.\nheartheart feels so heavy heavy constantly.. everything just feels so pointless if you",
